\item[S2] Wikipedia contributors, \emph{List of unsolved problems in mathematics}, revision 1366636767 (2026) Number theory, Are there any pairs of relatively prime amicable numbers. \url{https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=List_of_unsolved_problems_in_mathematics&oldid=1366636767#Number_theory}.
\item[S3] Zhipeng Chen, Haolun Tang and Jingyi Zhan, \emph{Formalization of Amicable Numbers Theory}, arXiv:2601.07444 (2026) Definitions 2.2 and 2.7, and Section 2.3. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2601.07444}.
